Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 15:47:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 07/12] usb: add the J71t gadget, Lightning host role and PHY
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

DWC2 gadget support, the Lightning camera-adapter host role switch
and the S8000 USB PHY.

From the release 2 kernel of the iPad 5 port
(https://github.com/brkosebay/omarchy-ipad5), filtered for OrchardLinux.

Signed-off-by: Berkay Kösebay <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
